---
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="My little bio"
  pubDate={new Date("September 23, 2025")}
>
  <p>
    I'm Zied Yousfi, 19 y/o. I'm disabled (SMA) and I've always lived near
    Paris. That gave me a shit ton of time to learn various stuff.
  </p>

  <p>
    For about 11 years I attended EREA Toulouse-Lautrec for my schooling. In
    that time I learned a lot about various art techniques, and this led me to
    go to Paris 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne for a Licence Arts Plastiques (September
    2023). The workload burned me out and I went through a few episodes of
    depression, so I stopped (May 2025).
  </p>

  <p>
    I still absolutely love arts and it's community. And that's why I keep
    creating and engaging with it on my free time.
  </p>

  <p>
    Back in the day, I used to spend my free time creating minecraft mods,
    discord bots, and a whole bunch of other fun projects. But because life is
    what it is, I had to put those hobbies aside for a while. Recently
    (December 2024) my father asked me to help him with a project, and that
    reignited my passion for coding. (Also there was Theo of t3 and
    ThePrimeagen) After stopping my studies, I fell in love with the world of
    software engineering. So here I am, back to coding, and loving it.
  </p>

  <p>
    I am now looking for a job in that field. I am particularly interested in
    front-end development, but I am open to other opportunities as well. I am
    eager to learn and grow as a developer, and I am excited to see where this
    journey takes me and what fate has in store for me.
  </p>

  <p>
    I also love gaming, music, and anime. I'm a big fan of Cyberpunk 2077, and I
    play a lot of multiplayer games like Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege and
    League of Legends. I enjoy listening to music, especially DnB. But my world
    is so big that I can't fit it all in this page. ;)
  </p>

  <p>
    Feel free to reach out to me on
    <a href="https://x.com/ziedsanstalent" target="_blank">X/Twitter</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    And please never forget that this world needs you and that you are loved.
  </p>
</Layout>
